      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"hg-handout hg-rules\"><div class=\"hg-handout-head\"><img src=\"modules/hollow-garden/assets/host/mic-welcome.webp\" alt=\"\"><h2>THE HOLLOW GARDEN</h2><p class=\"hg-sub\">Звёздные Искатели · Official Rules of the Show</p></div><ol><li>Every contestant gets an episode of their own.</li><li>Rest only in the Green Room. Intermissions cost ratings.</li><li>Nobody leaves early.</li><li>Heroic, brave, vile or debased acts earn prizes.</li><li>Audience votes are final.</li></ol><p class=\"hg-fine\">Contestants, the doors are open and the stakes are personal!</p></div>"
